+| Control | commands on every surface; icon-only chrome32 with hover/focus labels | primary, secondary, danger, chrome, navigation; disabled/hover/pressed/focus | explicit visible-control traversal; Enter/Space; disabled omitted | density padding; toolbar wraps |
+| Navigation | all 27 destinations | 3-unit selected side marker, hover, focused; native group icons | Tab and Ctrl+K; hidden items omitted; focus moves to visible toggle | preferred256; bounded drag200..420/window; rail52; scroll |
